      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The \"War Demons' Hideout\" is apparently accessed by \nwind-swept vertical shaft near Betland Bridge, \na common patrol area for the orc army.",
        "Jp" : "\"でだ、奴らのアジト《戦鬼の影穴》は\nオーク軍の出没が多い《バートランド大橋》近くの\n\"風の吹き込む縦穴\"から続いているらしい\""
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286370,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Based on that clue, an advance party went to\ninvestigate that area three days ago. \nThe fact that they haven't returned...",
        "Jp" : "それを手がかりに先発隊がその辺りを\n調べにいったのが、３日前\nさすがにもう帰っていないとおかしい――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286371,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Could you follow the same lead and look into\nthe War Demons' Hideout?",
        "Jp" : "《戦鬼の影穴》について\nお前も同じ手掛かりで追ってみてくれないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286372,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The real objective is to eliminate the orc\ncommander hiding there. He's Mogok's right-hand\nman, Gesomu the War Demon.",
        "Jp" : "真の目的は、そこにいるであろう\n潜伏したオーク部隊の指揮官、\nモゴックの腹心《戦鬼ゲソム》の討伐だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286373,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This mission is too much for an average\ntrooper. I think only you can handle it.\nI'm counting on you again.",
        "Jp" : "この任務、やはり並みの隊士には\n荷が重かった――\nできるとしたらお前くらいだと思ってるんだ\nまた頼りにさせてもらうぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286374,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
