      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I see... \nSo their hideout was connected \nto that dry well? \n\nAnd you took down Gesomu the War Demon?!",
        "Jp" : "なるほど――\n奴らのアジトはあの枯れ井戸から\n続いていたのか\nしかも《戦鬼ゲソム》を倒したのか！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286376,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Incredible! You defeated the Orc Commander\nand even took out the underlings to boot.",
        "Jp" : "大したもんだ！！\nオーク指揮官を倒し、小部隊までみごと\n蹴散らすなんてな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286377,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But I have some bad news. Turns out that \"Gesomu\nthe War Demon\" isn't the orc's name but a title\ngiven to the leader of their unit.",
        "Jp" : "――だがこっちから一つ悪い報せがある\n《戦鬼ゲソム》というのはオークの名というより\n部隊の長に与えられる階級の渾名らしい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286378,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Meaning, there could easily be a second or third\nGesomu lurking around. We'll need to keep\nmonitoring the area.",
        "Jp" : "つまり、第二第三のゲソムがたむろする\n可能性も十分あるってことだ\n引き続き監視していく必要があるな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286379,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Man, you're really something! No wonder the\ncaptain and vice-captain respect you. I'm proud to\ncall you my rival.",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、それにしてもやっぱすごいよお前は！\n統率と副隊長が一目置くだけはあるよ\n俺もライバルとして鼻が高いな、うん"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286380,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
